{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484310/extras/\u0437\u0430\u0433\u0440\u0443\u0436\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0435.png?t=1743024943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A short visual novel about fear, choice, miracle, adventure, friendship, love. A game for one warm, dreamy evening with a cup of tea and cookies. At the beginning of the story, a small surprise awaits in the form of a mini-platformer to find out what happens next.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484310/extras/1__1_.jpg?t=1743024943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The game is based on the story &quot;Twilight&quot; by Sveta Sky.</i><br><i>Images, backgrounds, characters, styles are created by artificial intelligence.</i><br><i>Translation into other languages \u200b\u200bis done manually using a translator.</i><br><i>The developer, the author of the text is Sveta Sky.</i><br><i>The game is created on the Ren'Py engine.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484310/extras/9.jpg?t=1743024943\" /><i></i><br><i>The base language is Russian. The translation may contain untranslatable variables.</i><br><i>The visual novel also includes a small platformer mini-game in Python.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Detailed information about free publicly available assets can be found in the description in the game itself, as well as in the game folder. </i><br><i>To start learning the story, the player must grant victory to the zombies. </i><br><i>The game contains sounds, backgrounds, melodies that may cause anxiety.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484310/extras/10.jpg?t=1743024943\" /><i></i><br><i>It is recommended to play in silence, without unnecessary background noise, at night for a greater effect.</i><br><i>The novella takes from 2 to 4 hours to complete.</i><br><i>Immerse yourself in a short story on a warm evening!</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u0422\u0451\u043c\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u043b\u0435\u0441","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3484310/b9ff755dea0ef74d086eb9fdf21c1aee877f1ce0.jpg"},{"name":"\u0416\u0443\u0442\u043a\u0430\u044f \u0432\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0447\u0430","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3484310/4fddba559a48957f95f04c9842d169245a1e05ef.jpg"},{"name":"\u0412\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0447\u0430 \u0441\u0443\u0434\u044c\u0431\u044b","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3484310/e21dfe3f6734573b0c4b6e6bd1164a58df9544d8.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484310?t=1743024943","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484310/54350b5aa57c60d815b6d4e5ac6a117a4fa6e9fd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743024943","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484310/d4f0b910cda646e2b5c6b8961a8b51473cef6ec5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743024943","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484310/d4f0b910cda646e2b5c6b8961a8b51473cef6ec5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743024943","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484310/extras/\u0437\u0430\u0433\u0440\u0443\u0436\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0435.png?t=1743024943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A short visual novel about fea